# Failure Analysis & Research Insights

用于 refine-logs/contracts/FAILURE_ANALYSIS.md；每条关联原始日志，保留负结果。

## Attempt (repeat)
- cycle / stage / hypothesis & claim IDs / method revision:
- run / attempt / code commit / plan & config hashes / raw outputs & audit:
- original prediction / observed facts / tested conditions:
- required vs completed valid runs / missing & deferred items / reasons:
- implementation / protocol / sampling / method / hypothesis / unresolved:
- diagnosis evidence / ruled-out explanations / unresolved confounders:
- conclusion: not_supported / inconclusive / refuted_in_scope / other scoped status:
- scope & limitations / falsification conditions met / untested conditions:
- stop decision: decisive predeclared condition or resource/priority decision:

## Insight (repeat, or explicitly none)
- stable insight ID / source attempt & evidence:
- observation (fact):
- interpretation (hypothesis):
- possible inspiration / reusable mechanism, component or boundary (unverified):
- applicability conditions / competing explanations / next discriminating test:
- validation status / later cycle & claim links / adopted or not & reason:
- similar previous attempt / new evidence or changed condition justifying retry:

## Revision & Handoff
- old/new revision / preserved negative evidence / superseded conclusion:
- unchanged goal, constraints & evaluation standard / semantic diff:
- affected novelty / design / scientific audit / approval / writing checks:
- trusted checkpoint, commit & artifact hashes / unresolved issues / next action:
